# Requiem for the Departed (crystalWar 23, call-only): a level 99 Warrior in the Eldieme Necropolis [S] with the Bronze
# Ribbon of Service (missions as group 1's flows). Heptachiond 105, finished: the quest added; again: 106. Fort
# Karugo-Narugo [S]: Pecca-Pocca 234, finished: the Sheaf of Handmade Incense; again: her script's 233. Eldieme [S]:
# Heptachiond 107, finished: completed (the Scroll of Recall-Meriph), the incense taken; again: 108. Pecca-Pocca
# completed: 233.
lists TheEldiemeNecropolisS/Heptachiond/onTrigger FortKarugoNarugoS/Pecca-Pocca/onTrigger TheEldiemeNecropolisS/onEventFinish/105 TheEldiemeNecropolisS/onEventFinish/107 FortKarugoNarugoS/onEventFinish/234
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolisS pos=257.696,-31.999,20.073 job=WAR lvl=99
keyitem BronzeRibbonOfService
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Heptachiond                     # available, the ribbon, level 30+: 105
finish                                  # the quest added
trigger Heptachiond                     # accepted, no incense: 106
finish
warp -161.478,-67.999,-155.099 FortKarugoNarugoS
trigger Pecca-Pocca                     # accepted, no incense: 234
finish                                  # the Sheaf of Handmade Incense
trigger Pecca-Pocca                     # the incense: her script's 233
finish
warp 257.696,-31.999,20.073 TheEldiemeNecropolisS
trigger Heptachiond                     # the incense: 107
finish                                  # completed (the Scroll of Recall-Meriph); the incense taken
trigger Heptachiond                     # completed: 108
finish
warp -161.478,-67.999,-155.099 FortKarugoNarugoS
trigger Pecca-Pocca                     # completed: 233
finish
